#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Samba"
msgstr "Instalação do Samba"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To support the test suite, set up a Python virtual environment for some "
"Python modules out of the scope of BLFS:"
msgstr ""
"Para suportar a suíte de teste, configure um ambiente virtual Python para "
"alguns módulos Python fora do escopo do BLFS:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:174
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">python3 -m venv --system-site-packages pyvenv         &amp;&amp;\n"
"./pyvenv/bin/pip3 install cryptography pyasn1 iso8601</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">python3 -m venv --system-site-packages pyvenv         &amp;&amp;\n"
"./pyvenv/bin/pip3 install cryptography pyasn1 iso8601</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:178
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Samba</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Samba</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:182
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>PYTHON=$PWD/pyvenv/bin/python3             \\\n"
"PATH=$PWD/pyvenv/bin:$PATH                 \\\n"
"./configure                                \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr                          \\\n"
"    --sysconfdir=/etc                      \\\n"
"    --localstatedir=/var                   \\\n"
"    --with-piddir=/run/samba               \\\n"
"    --with-pammodulesdir=/usr/lib/security \\\n"
"    --enable-fhs                           \\\n"
"    --without-ad-dc                        \\\n"
"    --without-systemd                      \\\n"
"    --with-system-mitkrb5                  \\\n"
"    --enable-selftest                      \\\n"
"    --disable-rpath-install                &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>PYTHON=$PWD/pyvenv/bin/python3             \\\n"
"PATH=$PWD/pyvenv/bin:$PATH                 \\\n"
"./configure                                \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr                          \\\n"
"    --sysconfdir=/etc                      \\\n"
"    --localstatedir=/var                   \\\n"
"    --with-piddir=/run/samba               \\\n"
"    --with-pammodulesdir=/usr/lib/security \\\n"
"    --enable-fhs                           \\\n"
"    --without-ad-dc                        \\\n"
"    --without-systemd                      \\\n"
"    --with-system-mitkrb5                  \\\n"
"    --enable-selftest                      \\\n"
"    --disable-rpath-install                &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:198
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>PYTHON=$PWD/pyvenv/bin/python3             \\\n"
"./configure                                \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr                          \\\n"
"    --sysconfdir=/etc                      \\\n"
"    --localstatedir=/var                   \\\n"
"    --with-piddir=/run/samba               \\\n"
"    --with-pammodulesdir=/usr/lib/security \\\n"
"    --enable-fhs                           \\\n"
"    --without-ad-dc                        \\\n"
"    --with-system-mitkrb5                  \\\n"
"    --enable-selftest                      \\\n"
"    --disable-rpath-install                &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>PYTHON=$PWD/pyvenv/bin/python3             \\\n"
"./configure                                \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr                          \\\n"
"    --sysconfdir=/etc                      \\\n"
"    --localstatedir=/var                   \\\n"
"    --with-piddir=/run/samba               \\\n"
"    --with-pammodulesdir=/usr/lib/security \\\n"
"    --enable-fhs                           \\\n"
"    --without-ad-dc                        \\\n"
"    --with-system-mitkrb5                  \\\n"
"    --enable-selftest                      \\\n"
"    --disable-rpath-install                &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:213
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>PATH=$PWD/pyvenv/bin:$PATH make "
"quicktest</command>. The test suite will produce lines that look like "
"failures, but these are innocuous.  The last few lines of output should "
"report <emphasis>\"ALL OK\"</emphasis> for a good test run. A summary of any"
" failures can be found in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">./st/summary</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: &quot;<command>PATH=$PWD/pyvenv/bin:$PATH "
"make quicktest</command>&quot;. A suíte de teste produzirá linhas que "
"parecem falhas, mas são inócuas. As últimas linhas da saída gerada deveriam "
"informar <emphasis>\"ALL OK\"</emphasis> para uma execução boa do teste. Um "
"resumo de quaisquer falhas pode ser encontrado em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">./st/summary</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Additionally, developer test suites are available. If you've installed the "
"optional python modules above in the Python virtual environment for building"
" this package, you can run these tests with <command>make test</command>. It"
" is not recommended for the average builder at around 290 SBU and over a "
"gigabyte of disk space, and you should expect ~73 errors and ~30 failures "
"from the 3000+ tests."
msgstr ""
"Além disso, suítes de teste para desenvolvedores(as) estão disponíveis. Se "
"você instalou os módulos opcionais &quot;Python&quot; acima no ambiente "
"virtual &quot;Python&quot; para construir esse pacote, [então] você consegue"
" executar esses testes com &quot;<command>make test</command>&quot;. Não é "
"recomendado para o(a) construtor(a) médio(a) com cerca de duzentos e noventa"
" (290) UPC e mais que um gigabyte de espaço em disco, e você deveria esperar"
" cerca de setenta e três (73) erros e cerca de trinta (30) falhas "
"originários dos mais que três mil (3.000) testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid "Fix hard coded paths to Python 3 interpreter:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija caminhos rigidamente codificados para o interpretador Python 3:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:247
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed '1s@^.*$@#!/usr/bin/python3@' \\\n"
"    -i ./bin/default/source4/scripting/bin/*.inst</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed '1s@^.*$@#!/usr/bin/python3@' \\\n"
"    -i ./bin/default/source4/scripting/bin/*.inst</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:251
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If upgrading from an old version of samba, as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, remove the old Python support "
"files to prevent some issues:"
msgstr ""
"Se atualizar a partir de uma versão antiga do samba, [então] como o(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, "
"remova os arquivos antigos de suporte do &quot;Python&quot; para evitar "
"alguns problemas:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:256
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm -rf /usr/lib/python&python3-majorver;/site-"
"packages/samba</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -rf /usr/lib/python&python3-majorver;/site-"
"packages/samba</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Still as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, install "
"the package:"
msgstr ""
"Ainda como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;, instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:263
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644 examples/smb.conf.default /etc/samba &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s;log file =.*;log file = /var/log/samba/%m.log;\"   \\\n"
"    -e \"s;path = /usr/spool/samba;path = /var/spool/samba;\" \\\n"
"    -i /etc/samba/smb.conf.default &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /etc/openldap/schema &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644    examples/LDAP/README \\\n"
"                    /etc/openldap/schema/README.samba &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644    examples/LDAP/samba* \\\n"
"                    /etc/openldap/schema &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755    examples/LDAP/{get*,ol*} \\\n"
"                    /etc/openldap/schema</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644 examples/smb.conf.default /etc/samba &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s;log file =.*;log file = /var/log/samba/%m.log;\"   \\\n"
"    -e \"s;path = /usr/spool/samba;path = /var/spool/samba;\" \\\n"
"    -i /etc/samba/smb.conf.default &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /etc/openldap/schema &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644    examples/LDAP/README \\\n"
"                    /etc/openldap/schema/README.samba &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644    examples/LDAP/samba* \\\n"
"                    /etc/openldap/schema &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m755    examples/LDAP/{get*,ol*} \\\n"
"                    /etc/openldap/schema</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:285
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:291
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-fhs</parameter>: Assigns all other file paths in a "
"manner compliant with the Filesystem Hierarchy Standard (FHS)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-fhs</parameter>: Atribui todos os outros caminhos de "
"arquivo de maneira compatível com o &quot;Filesystem Hierarchy "
"Standard&quot; (&quot;FHS&quot;)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:296
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--without-systemd</parameter>: Disable "
"<application>systemd</application> integration, since it is not built in the"
" System V version of LFS/BLFS."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--without-systemd</parameter>: Desabilite a integração "
"&quot;<application>systemd</application>&quot;, uma vez que ela não é "
"construída na versão &quot;System V&quot; do LFS/BLFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:302
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-shared-modules='!vfs_snapper'</option>: Disable the "
"vfs_snapper module if you want to build samba without "
"<application>dbus</application> support, for setups without graphical user "
"interfaces."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-shared-modules='!vfs_snapper'</option>: Desabilite o módulo "
"vfs_snapper se você quiser construir samba sem suporte a "
"<application>dbus</application>, para configurações sem interfaces gráficas "
"de usuário(a)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--without-ad-dc</parameter>: Disables Active Directory Domain "
"Controller functionality. See <ulink url= "
"\"https://wiki.samba.org/index.php/Setup_a_Samba_Active_Directory_Domain_Controller\">"
" Set up a Samba Active Directory Domain Controller</ulink> for detailed "
"information. Remove this switch if you've installed the Python modules "
"needed for ADS support. Note that BLFS does not provide a samba bootscript "
"or systemd unit for an Active Directory domain controller."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--without-ad-dc</parameter>: Desabilita a funcionalidade do "
"Controlador de Domínio do &quot;Active Directory&quot;. Veja-se <ulink url= "
"\"https://wiki.samba.org/index.php/Setup_a_Samba_Active_Directory_Domain_Controller\">Configurar"
" um Controlador de Domínio Samba do Active Directory</ulink> para "
"informações detalhadas. Remova essa chave se você tiver instalado os módulos"
" &quot;Python&quot; necessários para suporte &quot;ADS&quot;. Observe que o "
"BLFS não fornece um conjunto de comandos sequenciais de inicialização ou "
"unidade do &quot;systemd&quot; do Samba para um controlador de domínio do "
"&quot;Active Directory&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:317
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-mitkrb5</parameter>: Enables building with the "
"system version of Kerberos. This mitigates security vulnerabilities and "
"reduces build time.  Remove this if you do not have <xref "
"linkend=\"mitkrb\"/> installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-mitkrb5</parameter>: Habilita construir com a "
"versão do sistema do Kerberos. Isso atenua vulnerabilidades de segurança e "
"reduz o tempo de construção. Remova isso se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"mitkrb\"/> instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:326
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-rpath-install</parameter>: Removes the library "
"installation path from embedded shared library search paths in the installed"
" binary executable files and shared libraries.  When this package is "
"installed into the standard location the library installation path is "
"<filename class='directory'>/usr/lib</filename>.  It's always searched by "
"the dynamic linker, so there is no need to embed it into installed files."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-rpath-install</parameter>: Remove o caminho de "
"instalação da biblioteca dos caminhos incorporados de pesquisa de "
"bibliotecas compartilhadas nos arquivos executáveis binários instalados e "
"nas bibliotecas compartilhadas. Quando esse pacote é instalado no local "
"padrão, o caminho de instalação da biblioteca é <filename "
"class='directory'>/usr/lib</filename>. Ele sempre é pesquisado pelo "
"vinculador dinâmico, de forma que não existe necessidade de incorporá-lo aos"
" arquivos instalados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:336
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-selftest-prefix=SELFTEST_PREFIX</option>: This option "
"specifies the test suite work directory (default=./st)."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-selftest-prefix=SELFTEST_PREFIX</option>: Essa opção "
"especifica o diretório de trabalho da suíte de teste (padrão=./st)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:341
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m644 examples/LDAP/* /etc/openldap/schema</command>: "
"These commands are used to copy sample Samba schemas to the OpenLDAP "
"<filename class='directory'>schema</filename> directory."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m644 examples/LDAP/* /etc/openldap/schema</command>: "
"Esses comandos são usados para copiar esquemas de amostra do "
"&quot;Samba&quot; para o diretório &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>schema</filename>&quot; do &quot;OpenLDAP&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:347
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m644 ../examples/smb.conf.default /etc/samba</command>:"
" This copies a default <filename>smb.conf</filename> file into "
"<filename>/etc/samba</filename>. This sample configuration will not work "
"until you copy it to <filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> and make the "
"appropriate changes for your installation. See the configuration section for"
" minimum values which must be set."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m644 ../examples/smb.conf.default /etc/samba</command>:"
" Isso copia um arquivo padrão &quot;<filename>smb.conf</filename>&quot; em "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba</filename>&quot;. Essa amostra de configuração "
"não funcionará até que você a copie para "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot; e faça as mudanças "
"apropriadas para a tua instalação. Veja-se a seção de configuração para os "
"valores mínimos que precisam estar configurados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:358
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Samba"
msgstr "Configurando o Samba"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:361
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:364
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:368
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/samba/smb.conf"
msgstr "/etc/samba/smb.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:374
#, xml-text
msgid "Printing to SMB Clients"
msgstr "Impressão para clientes SMB"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:377
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you use <application>CUPS</application> for print services, and you wish "
"to print to a printer attached to an SMB client, you need to create an SMB "
"backend device. To create the device, issue the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você usa &quot;<application>CUPS</application>&quot; para serviços de "
"impressão e deseja imprimir em uma impressora conectada a um cliente "
"&quot;SMB&quot;, [então] você precisa criar um dispositivo de estrutura de "
"retaguarda &quot;SMB&quot;. Para criar o dispositivo, emita o seguinte "
"comando como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:383
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -dvm 755 /usr/lib/cups/backend &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -sf /usr/bin/smbspool /usr/lib/cups/backend/smb</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -dvm 755 /usr/lib/cups/backend &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -v -sf /usr/bin/smbspool /usr/lib/cups/backend/smb</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:389
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:392
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Due to the complexity and the many various uses for "
"<application>Samba</application>, complete configuration for all the "
"package's capabilities is well beyond the scope of the BLFS book. This "
"section provides instructions to configure the "
"<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> file for two common scenarios.  The"
" complete contents of <filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> will depend "
"on the purpose of <application>Samba</application> installation."
msgstr ""
"Devido à complexidade e aos diversos usos do "
"&quot;<application>Samba</application>&quot;, a configuração completa para "
"todos os recursos do pacote está bem além do escopo do livro BLFS. Esta "
"seção fornece instruções para configurar o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot; para dois cenários "
"comuns. O conteúdo completo de "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot; dependerá do propósito "
"da instalação do &quot;<application>Samba</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:404
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You may find it easier to copy the configuration parameters shown below into"
" an empty <filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> file instead of copying "
"and editing the default file as mentioned in the <quote>Command "
"Explanations</quote> section. How you create/edit the "
"<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> file will be left up to you. Do "
"ensure the file is only writable by the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user (mode 644)."
msgstr ""
"Você possivelmente ache mais fácil copiar os parâmetros de configuração "
"mostrados abaixo em um arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot; vazio em vez de copiar "
"e editar o arquivo padrão conforme mencionado na seção <quote>Explicações do"
" Comando</quote>. Como você cria/edita o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot; será deixado a seu "
"critério. Certifique-se de que o arquivo só possa ser escrevível pelo(a) "
"usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot; "
"(modo 644)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:415
#, xml-text
msgid "Scenario 1: Minimal Standalone Client-Only Installation"
msgstr "Cenário 1: instalação Mínima Autônoma Somente para Cliente"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Choose this variant if you only want to transfer files using "
"<command>smbclient</command>, mount Windows shares and print to Windows "
"printers, and don't want to share your files and printers to Windows "
"machines."
msgstr ""
"Escolha essa variante se você quiser somente transferir arquivos usando "
"&quot;<command>smbclient</command>&quot;, montar compartilhamentos do "
"Windows e imprimir em impressoras Windows e não quiser compartilhar teus "
"arquivos e impressoras com máquinas Windows."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:425
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A <filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> file with the following three "
"parameters is sufficient:"
msgstr ""
"Um arquivo &quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot; com os "
"seguintes três parâmetros é suficiente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:429
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>[global]\n"
"    workgroup = <replaceable>WORKGROUP</replaceable>\n"
"    dos charset = <replaceable>cp850</replaceable>\n"
"    unix charset = <replaceable>ISO-8859-1</replaceable></literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>[global]\n"
"    workgroup = <replaceable>GRUPO_DE_TRABALHO</replaceable>\n"
"    dos charset = <replaceable>cp850</replaceable>\n"
"    unix charset = <replaceable>ISO-8859-1</replaceable></literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:435
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The values in this example specify that the computer belongs to a Windows "
"workgroup named <literal><replaceable>WORKGROUP</replaceable></literal>, "
"uses the <literal><replaceable>cp850</replaceable></literal> character set "
"on the wire when talking to MS-DOS and MS Windows 9x, and that the filenames"
" are stored in the <literal><replaceable>ISO-8859-1</replaceable></literal> "
"encoding on the disk. Adjust these values appropriately for your "
"installation. The <literal>unix charset</literal> value must be the same as "
"the output of <command>locale charmap</command> when executed with the "
"<envar>LANG</envar> variable set to your preferred locale, otherwise the "
"<command>ls</command> command may not display correct filenames of "
"downloaded files."
msgstr ""
"Os valores nesse exemplo especificam que o computador pertence a um grupo de"
" trabalho do Windows chamado "
"<literal><replaceable>GRUPO_DE_TRABALHO</replaceable></literal>, que usa o "
"conjunto de caracteres <literal><replaceable>cp850</replaceable></literal> "
"na rede ao conversar com MS-DOS e MS Windows 9x, e que os nomes dos arquivos"
" são armazenados na codificação "
"<literal><replaceable>ISO-8859-1</replaceable></literal> no disco. Ajuste "
"esses valores adequadamente para a tua instalação. O valor <literal>unix "
"charset</literal> precisa ser o mesmo que a saída gerada de <command>locale "
"charmap</command> quando executado com a variável <envar>LANG</envar> "
"configurada para a tua localidade preferida, caso contrário o comando "
"<command>ls</command> possivelmente não exiba nomes de arquivos corretos dos"
" arquivos baixados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:450
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There is no need to run any <application>Samba</application> servers in this"
" scenario, thus you don't need to install the provided <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\">bootscripts.</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">systemd"
" units.</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"Não existe necessidade de executar quaisquer servidores "
"&quot;<application>Samba</application>&quot; nesse cenário; portanto, você "
"não precisa instalar <phrase revision=\"sysv\">os conjuntos de comandos "
"sequenciais de inicialização fornecidos.</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">as unidades &quot;systemd&quot; fornecidas.</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:459
#, xml-text
msgid "Scenario 2: Standalone File/Print Server"
msgstr "Cenário 2: Servidor Autônomo de Arquivo/Impressão"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:462
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Choose this variant if you want to share your files and printers to Windows "
"machines in your workgroup in addition to the capabilities described in "
"Scenario 1."
msgstr ""
"Escolha essa variante se quiser compartilhar teus arquivos e impressoras com"
" máquinas Windows em teu grupo de trabalho, além dos recursos descritos no "
"Cenário 1."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:468
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In this case, the <filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf.default</filename> file may "
"be a good template to start from. Also, you should add the <quote>dos "
"charset</quote> and <quote>unix charset</quote> parameters to the "
"<quote>[global]</quote> section as described in Scenario 1 in order to "
"prevent filename corruption. For security reasons, you may wish to define "
"<replaceable>path = /home/alice/shared-files</replaceable>, assuming your "
"user name is <replaceable>alice</replaceable> and you only want to share the"
" files in that directory, instead of your entire home. Then, replace "
"<replaceable>homes</replaceable> by <replaceable>shared-files</replaceable> "
"and change also the <quote><literal>comment</literal></quote> if used the "
"configuration file below or the "
"<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf.default</filename> to create yours."
msgstr ""
"Nesse caso, o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf.default</filename>&quot; possivelmente "
"seja um bom modelo para começar. Além disso, você deveria adicionar os "
"parâmetros <quote>dos charset</quote> e <quote>unix charset</quote> à seção "
"<quote>[global]</quote> conforme descrito no Cenário 1 para a finalidade de "
"evitar corrupção de nome de arquivo . Por razões de segurança, você "
"possivelmente deseje definir &quot;<replaceable>path = /home/alice/arquivos-"
"compartilhados</replaceable>&quot;, assumindo que teu nome de usuário(a) "
"seja <replaceable>alice</replaceable> e que você quer somente compartilhar "
"os arquivos nesse diretório, em vez de todo o teu &quot;home&quot;. Em "
"seguida, substitua &quot;<replaceable>homes</replaceable>&quot; por "
"&quot;<replaceable>arquivos-compartilhados</replaceable>&quot; e mude também"
" o <quote><literal>comment</literal></quote> se usado o arquivo de "
"configuração abaixo ou o "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf.default</filename>&quot; para criar o "
"teu."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:485
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The following configuration file creates a separate share for each user's "
"home directory and also makes all printers available to Windows machines:"
msgstr ""
"O arquivo de configuração a seguir cria um compartilhamento separado para "
"cada diretório inicial de usuário e também torna todas as impressoras "
"disponíveis para máquinas Windows:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:490
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>[global]\n"
"    workgroup = <replaceable>WORKGROUP</replaceable>\n"
"    dos charset = <replaceable>cp850</replaceable>\n"
"    unix charset = <replaceable>ISO-8859-1</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[homes]\n"
"    comment = Home Directories\n"
"    browseable = no\n"
"    writable = yes\n"
"\n"
"[printers]\n"
"    comment = All Printers\n"
"    path = /var/spool/samba\n"
"    browseable = no\n"
"    guest ok = no\n"
"    printable = yes</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>[global]\n"
"    workgroup = <replaceable>GRUPO_DE_TRABALHO</replaceable>\n"
"    dos charset = <replaceable>cp850</replaceable>\n"
"    unix charset = <replaceable>ISO-8859-1</replaceable>\n"
"\n"
"[homes]\n"
"    comment = Diretórios Home\n"
"    browseable = no\n"
"    writable = yes\n"
"\n"
"[printers]\n"
"    comment = Todas Impressoras\n"
"    path = /var/spool/samba\n"
"    browseable = no\n"
"    guest ok = no\n"
"    printable = yes</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:508
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Other parameters you may wish to customize in the <quote>[global]</quote> "
"section include:"
msgstr ""
"Outros parâmetros que você possivelmente queira personalizar na seção "
"<quote>[global]</quote> incluem:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:512
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>    server string =\n"
"    security =\n"
"    hosts allow =\n"
"    load printers =\n"
"    log file =\n"
"    max log size =\n"
"    socket options =\n"
"    local master =</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>    server string =\n"
"    security =\n"
"    hosts allow =\n"
"    load printers =\n"
"    log file =\n"
"    max log size =\n"
"    socket options =\n"
"    local master =</literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:522
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Reference the comments in the "
"<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf.default</filename> file for information "
"regarding these parameters."
msgstr ""
"Consulte os comentários no arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf.default</filename>&quot; para "
"informações relativas a esses parâmetros."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:528
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Since the <command>smbd</command> and <command>nmbd</command> daemons are "
"needed in this case, install the <filename>samba</filename> <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\">bootscript.</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">systemd "
"unit.</phrase> Be sure to run <command>smbpasswd</command> (with the "
"<option>-a</option> option to add users) to enable and set passwords for all"
" accounts that need <application>Samba</application> access.  Using the "
"default <application>Samba</application> passdb backend, any user you "
"attempt to add will also be required to exist in the "
"<filename>/etc/passwd</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"Como os processos de segundo plano <command>smbd</command> e "
"<command>nmbd</command> são necessários nesse caso, instale <phrase "
"revision=\"sysv\">o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de "
"inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">a unidade do "
"systemd</phrase> do <filename>samba</filename>. Certifique-se de executar "
"<command>smbpasswd</command> (com a opção <option>-a</option> para adicionar"
" usuários(as)) para habilitar e configurar senhas para todas as contas que "
"precisam de acesso ao <application>Samba</application>. Usando a estrutura "
"de retaguarda passdb padrão do <application>Samba</application>, qualquer "
"usuário(a) que você tentar adicionar também será exigido(a) existir no "
"arquivo <filename>/etc/passwd</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:543
#, xml-text
msgid "Advanced Requirements"
msgstr "Exigências Avançadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:546
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"More complex scenarios involving domain control or membership are possible. "
"Such setups are advanced topics and cannot be adequately covered in BLFS. "
"Many complete books have been written on these topics alone. Note that in "
"some domain membership scenarios, the <command>winbindd</command> daemon and"
" the corresponding <phrase revision=\"sysv\">bootscript</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">systemd unit</phrase> are needed."
msgstr ""
"Cenários mais complexos envolvendo controle de domínio ou associação são "
"possíveis. Essas configurações são tópicos avançados e não podem ser "
"abordadas adequadamente no BLFS. Muitos livros completos foram escritos "
"apenas a respeito desses tópicos. Observe que, em alguns cenários de "
"associação de domínio, o processo de segundo plano "
"&quot;<command>winbindd</command>&quot; e <phrase revision=\"sysv\">o "
"conjunto de comandos sequenciais de inicialização</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">a unidade do &quot;systemd&quot;</phrase> "
"correspondente são necessários."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:558
#, xml-text
msgid "Guest account"
msgstr "Conta de visitante"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:561
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The default <application>Samba</application> installation uses the "
"<systemitem class='username'>nobody</systemitem> user for guest access to "
"the server. This can be overridden by setting the <option>guest account "
"=</option> parameter in the <filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename> file. "
"If you utilize the <option>guest account =</option> parameter, ensure this "
"user exists in the <filename>/etc/passwd</filename> file."
msgstr ""
"A instalação padrão do &quot;<application>Samba</application>&quot; usa o(a)"
" usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class='username'>nobody</systemitem>&quot; "
"para acesso de visitante ao servidor. Isso pode ser substituído "
"configurando-se o parâmetro &quot;<option>guest account =</option>&quot; no "
"arquivo &quot;<filename>/etc/samba/smb.conf</filename>&quot;. Se você "
"utilizar o parâmetro &quot;<option>guest account =</option>&quot;, [então] "
"certifique-se de que esse(a) usuário(a) exista no arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>/etc/passwd</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:573
#, xml-text
msgid "Boot Script"
msgstr "Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de Inicialização"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><sect4><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netprogs/samba.xml:576
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For your convenience, boot scripts have been provided for "
"<application>Samba</application>. There are two included in the <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package. The first, <filename>samba</filename>, "
"will start the <command>smbd</command> and <command>nmbd</command> daemons "
"needed to provide SMB/CIFS services. The second script, "
"<filename>winbind</filename>, starts the <command>winbindd</command> daemon,"
" used for providing Windows domain services to Linux clients."
msgstr ""
"Para a tua conveniência, conjuntos de comandos sequenciais de inicialização "
"foram fornecidos para o &quot;<application>Samba</application>&quot;. "
"Existem dois incluídos no pacote &quot;<xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>&quot;. O primeiro, "
"&quot;<filename>samba</filename>&quot;, iniciará os processos de segundo "
"plano &quot;<command>smbd</command>&quot; e "
"&quot;<command>nmbd</command>&quot; necessários para fornecer serviços "
"&quot;SMB&quot;/&quot;CIFS&quot;. O segundo conjunto de comandos "
"sequenciais, &quot;<filename>winbind</filename>&quot;, inicia o processo de "
"segundo plano &quot;<command>winbindd</command>&quot;, usado para fornecer "
"serviços de domínio do Windows para clientes Linux."

